the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1058424,\"title\":\"Hope\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VY1ZKgpsc8CfGsQcCGiYEgHdH0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qqHFLg90IUSoTmSMpKOOW5RyqN3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor, police chief Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious creature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems, and perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1507696,\"title\":\"Apocalypse Z: New World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wXln4DUrwcyjcFPwgQxFPYTlG1Z.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o3XwuDUj0n8qnK91p6q8LKfr6rj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Canary Islands have become Europe’s last refuge following the outbreak of the TSJ virus. When a special mission sets out for the mainland in search of vital supplies, Roberto joins the team with questionable intentions. The dangerous operation turns into a desperate race for survival, and Roberto and his companions find themselves caught between hordes of infected and divided loyalties.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1381071,\"title\":\"Godzilla Minus Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1294189,\"title\":\"The Mongoose\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eSS5mvSG84UUuvtbHel5Yu3Wik4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bySCyjQXNPgsnLTlgJpSMnRazPD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A falsely accused war hero with nothing to lose leads police on an epic televised cross-country car chase, helped by members of his former Special Forces Army battalion and closely monitored by a fascinated public rooting for his safe getaway.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1288445,\"title\":\"Mutiny\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pu2VxGlpGwffOx292w18b1tv96j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qDa0fqDqIBCovRp975RvtGPcuN3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After witnessing his billionaire boss' murder and being framed for the crime, Cole Reed boards a cargo ship on a one-man crusade to avenge his boss' death only to discover an international conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1153576,\"title\":\"Street Fighter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccxdepKqORLwccbzvO4eAGkN0IC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1041019,\"title\":\"UFC Fight Night 213: Kattar vs. Allen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jBnVSWf0ahuUIHcXOh9JRDbNicx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lOdKlASqYZeCGKMh04tqOrCBRQA.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Featherweight Calvin Kattar vs. Arnold Allen  Welterweight Max Griffin vs. Tim Means  Heavyweight Jared Vanderaa vs. Waldo Cortes-Acosta  Middleweight Josh Fremd vs. Tresean Gore  Light Heavyweight Dustin Jacoby vs. Khalil Rountre